> ### Name: get_fsa_payments
> ### Title: Loads data from FSA individual payment files for specified years
> ###   and programs
> ### Aliases: get_fsa_payments
> 
> ### ** Examples
> 
> ## Not run: 
> ##D get_fsa_payments(year = 2024,
> ##D                                     program = c("ARC-CO","PLC"),
> ##D                                     year_type = "program",
> ##D                                     aggregation = "county")
> ## End(Not run)
